11. QUALITY AND COMPLIANCE CHECKS

The Performer must verify:

1. All statuses were reviewed.
2. Population reconciliation was completed.
3. Ageing thresholds were applied correctly.
4. Follow-up trackers were issued.
5. Duplicate LC/GC reporting was removed.
6. Evidence was retained.

The Validator must perform:

1. 100% review of the completed control.
2. Validation of population completeness.
3. Validation of follow-up actions.
4. Final sign-off by email.

